(7654697, 1246075, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love this.<br/> <br/>Perhaps a bit of a tickle to T.S. Eliot''s black and white Catholic moralism. or the shadows that haunted him. or the shadow between the motion and the act.<br/> <br/>What more could you want from a photo? the hero just arrived on his steed. the door waiting. the approach to the door, going from one world to another. and the one I love on a personal level, plenty of places to sit.<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I love this. Perhaps a bit of a tickle to T.S. Eliot''s black and white Catholic moralism. or the shadows that haunted him. or the shadow between the motion and the act. What more could you want from a photo? the hero just arrived on his steed. the door waiting. the approach to the door, going from one world to another. and the one I love on a personal level, plenty of places to sit. I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery ', '2020-03-01 23:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
